      "markdown": "# 课时 18 探索规律\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_84_457_170_546.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"4%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 夯实基础\n\n1. 想一想，填一填。\n\n(1) 找规律, 填一填。\n\n①1,4,9,16,(),(),()。\n\n②2,4,7,11,16,(),()。\n\n③2,3,4,5,8,7,(),()。\n\n④2,4,8,(),32,64,()。\n\n⑤ $ \\frac{1}{2},\\frac{2}{4},\\frac{(\\quad)}{(\\quad)},\\frac{4}{8},\\frac{(\\quad)}{(\\quad)},\\frac{(\\quad)}{(\\quad)} $。\n\n(2)☆○○☆○○☆○○……第 49 个图形是（ ）。\n\n(3)假设今天是星期二,再过25天是星期()。\n\n(4)\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_189_1449_426_1525.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_453_1419_648_1524.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_674_1389_979_1522.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"15%\" /></div>\n\n\n第 10 个图形有( )个□。\n\n(5)按下图的规律,第12堆里应有( )个。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_187_1879_803_2003.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"30%\" /></div>\n\n\n①摆1个六边形用了6根小棒，摆2个六边形用了( )根小棒。\n\n②按照上面的方式继续摆下去,完成下表。\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>六边形个数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>小棒根数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>6</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ 6+5 $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>$ 6+5 \\times 2 $</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>六边形个数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>4</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>...</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>n</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>小棒根数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>...</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr></table>\n\n(7)小明有一串珠子,按下面的顺序排列。\n\n黄 ☐ 白 ☐ 白 红 ☐ 黄 ☐ 白 ☐ 白 红 …\n\n①第 74 颗珠子是( )色的。\n\n②如果这串珠子共有90颗，黄珠子有( )颗，白珠子有( )颗，红珠子有( )颗。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1046_457_1130_545.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"4%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 提升能力\n\n2. 数一数，一共有( )个长方形。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1336_656_1704_816.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n3.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1185_848_1315_978.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1368_835_1624_1016.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n第1个图形由1个小正方体搭成,第二个图形由8个小正方体搭成,那么第n个图形由多少个小正方体搭成?\n\n4. 用火柴搭三角形, 填写下表。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1381_1444_1508_1525.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1597_1445_1757_1525.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>三角形的个数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>4</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>...</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>n</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>火柴棒的根数</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>7</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>9</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>...</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr></table>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1045_1741_1132_1822.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"4%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 拓展思维\n\n5.下面是某月份的日历。\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期日</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期一</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期二</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期三</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期四</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期五</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>星期六</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>4</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>6</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>7</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>8</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>9</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>10</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>11</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>12</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>13</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>14</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>15</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>16</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>17</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>18</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>19</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>20</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>21</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>22</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>23</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>24</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>25</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>26</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>27</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>28</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>29</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>30</td></tr></table>\n\n(1)涂色区域中 5 个数之和与其正中间的数有什么关系?\n\n(2)用含有字母的式子表示这个关系。",
